  "details": "We would like to see support for the following Methods\n\n- FindAnyObjectByType\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/2022.3/Documentation/ScriptReference/Object.FindAnyObjectByType.html\n\n- FindObjectsByType\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/2022.3/Documentation/ScriptReference/Object.FindObjectsByType.html\n\nThis is a Methods already supported since Unity 2020.3 and is more speedy than `FindObjectOfType` & `FindObjectsOfType`.( because it does not sort by default )\n\nhttps://youtu.be/QJcU7jO5HZ8?t=161\n\nThis also removes the constraints of specifying in SerializeField or performing name or tag-specified searches in GameObject.Find.",
